      "raw_md": "# Manifest — DASHBOARD → user (deploy gh-pages) + AUDIT\n\n## Version\n0.0.0  (skeleton scaffolded; chưa có deploy nào do agent thực hiện)\n\nBump rule:\n- Visual / data shape thay đổi → minor.\n- Bug fix / copy / a11y polish → patch.\n- Major: data_contract bump major, hoặc rewrite tech stack.\n\n## Last updated\n2026-05-04 by DASHBOARD — staged Claude Sonnet unified description_gen run\n\n## Artifacts\n\n### staging:claude_sonnet_descgen_unified\n- Run dir: `results/consynthx_description_gen_claude_sonnet_cs10k_v1_unified_seed42/`\n  - `predictions.parquet` → symlink → `/fs/scratch/PGS0407/binben14/cveval-results/consynthx_description_gen_claude_sonnet_cs10k_v1_unified_seed42/predictions.parquet`\n  - `metrics.json` ← copy of `metrics_success_only.json` (success subset n=3703 / 6000 = 61.7%)\n  - `metrics_full_with_errors.json` ← copy of original `metrics.json` (kept for reference)\n- Surfaced in dashboard data.js:\n  - 12 conditions in matrix (clean / fog_{light,medium,heavy} / rain_{light,heavy,night} /\n    snow_{light,heavy,night} / night / small)\n  - Primary metric: BLEU-1 corpus = 0.180\n  - Nested metrics surfaced: BERTScore F1 = 0.189, METEOR = 0.273, CIDEr = 0.011,\n    ROUGE-L = 0.170\n- Caveat: run-level `n` shown in UI = 6000 (parquet rows) but metrics computed on\n  3703-success subset. parse_error_rate field in metrics.json = 0.0 (success-only).\n  Real failure rate = 38.3% (BadRequestError 400 image>5MB). User plans retry\n  full + downscale fix → metrics may shift slightly, pattern (Claude verbose →\n  low BLEU) expected to persist.\n- Build verified: `build_site()` ran clean Python 3.12; site/data.js regenerated\n  2026-05-04 16:00 UTC.\n\n(Chưa có deploy chính thức — chờ resolve open blockers trong `state/progress.md`\ntrước khi bump dashboard semver.)\n\nTemplate:\n\n```\n### dashboard:<version>\n- Build artifact path: site/\n- Build size: <KB total>\n- Tested viewports: 375 / 768 / 1440\n- Tested browsers: Chrome <ver>, Firefox <ver>, Safari <ver>\n- Last gh-pages commit: <sha>\n- data_contract version: 1.0.0\n- Runs included: <count>\n- Status: ready | partial | deprecated\n- Notes:\n```\n\n## Removed/Deprecated\n(none)\n",
